WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.010
- We are still celebrating
women's history month.

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:05.980
And at just 10 years old,
my next guest realized

00:00:05.980 --> 00:00:08.680
that boys were getting way
better access to sports

00:00:08.680 --> 00:00:10.950
than the girls in her hometown of Tampa.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.630
So of course she's 10 and she's awesome.

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:15.350
And she put pen to paper
and wrote to her mayor.

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.750
That letter became a
real catalyst for change

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:19.730
and she is what we in
our season long partner,

00:00:19.730 --> 00:00:23.730
Pilot G2 Pen, call an
unstoppable overachiever.

00:00:23.730 --> 00:00:25.633
