00:00:25.633 --> 00:00:26.466
- Hi.

00:00:26.466 --> 00:00:27.710
(audience cheering)

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.660
First meet Jessica, meet Rose.

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:30.493
- Hi.
- Hi.

00:00:30.493 --> 00:00:31.800
- Lovely to meet you.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:33.060
- Jessica, Rose, Evangeline

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:34.382
this is like a great novel so far ladies.

00:00:34.382 --> 00:00:35.215
