00:00:35.215 --> 00:00:36.660
Yes. I was like, your names are all...

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:38.770
So you've been into sports
for a while now, right?

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:41.450
- Yeah, I've played softball
for about five years,

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:42.856
so, half of my life.

00:00:42.856 --> 00:00:46.380
(ladies laughing)

